@startuml
title UML state machine diagram - Farm Management System

[*] --> SignIn : [Enter credentials]
state SignIn <<choice>>
SignIn --> MainArea : [Successful login]
SignIn --> Error : [Invalid credentials]

MainArea --> MarketConditions : [Select market conditions]
MainArea --> PestControlHelp : [Select pest control help]
MainArea --> SoilInfo : [Provide soil information]
MainArea --> Location : [Provide location]

state MarketConditions <<choice>>
MarketConditions --> MarketReport : [View market report]

state PestControlHelp <<choice>>
PestControlHelp --> Techniques : [View pest control techniques]

state SoilInfo <<choice>>
SoilInfo --> SuitableCrops : [Provide soil-related suggestions]

state Location <<choice>>
Location --> LabourDetails : [Display labour availability details]
Location --> WeatherInsights : [Offer weather insights]

MainArea --> Continue : [Continue using the service]
SignOut --> EndSession : [User logs out]

SignIn --> LoggedOut : [Logout]

title UML state machine diagram - Online Marketplace

[*] --> Registration : [Create account]
state Registration <<choice>>
Registration --> SellerWorkspace : [Seller registration and verification]
Registration --> CustomerDashboard : [Customer registration and verification]

SellerWorkspace --> AddProduct : [Add new products]
SellerWorkspace --> PromoteProduct : [Promote existing products]
SellerWorkspace --> Communicate : [Communicate with customers]
SellerWorkspace --> Logout : [Log out]

CustomerDashboard --> ExploreProducts : [Explore products]
CustomerDashboard --> SearchProducts : [Search and view available products]
CustomerDashboard --> Purchase : [Proceed with a purchase]
CustomerDashboard --> BrowseMore : [Stop browsing and continue browsing]
CustomerDashboard --> Logout : [Log out]

Registration --> RegistrationSuccess : [Successful registration]
Registration --> RegistrationError : [Invalid details]
SellerWorkspace --> AccessEnded : [Access ended]
CustomerDashboard --> AccessEnded : [Access ended]

title UML state machine diagram - Equihealth

[*] --> SignIn : [Enter credentials]
state SignIn <<choice>>
SignIn --> PatientDashboard : [Patients sign in]
SignIn --> HealthWorkerDashboard : [Health workers sign in]
SignIn --> GovernmentOfficialDashboard : [Government officials sign in]

PatientDashboard --> MedicalInfo : [Provide medical information]
HealthWorkerDashboard --> AnalyzeInfo : [Check and use the medical information provided by patients]
HealthWorkerDashboard --> Alerts : [Prepare alerts based on analyzed information]
GovernmentOfficialDashboard --> HealthPlanningResults : [Display health planning results]

PatientDashboard --> Logout : [Log out]
HealthWorkerDashboard --> Logout : [Log out]
GovernmentOfficialDashboard --> Logout : [Log out]

PatientDashboard --> AccessEnded : [Access ended]
HealthWorkerDashboard --> AccessEnded : [Access ended]
GovernmentOfficialDashboard --> AccessEnded : [Access ended]

title UML state machine diagram - Business Process Outsourcing Bpo Management System Scenario 1

[*] --> UserType : [Choose user type]
state UserType <<choice>>
UserType --> NewRegistration : [New user registration]
UserType --> Login : [Registered user login]

NewRegistration --> RegistrationSuccess : [Successful registration]
NewRegistration --> RegistrationError : [Invalid details]
Login --> LoginSuccess : [Successful login]
Login --> LoginError : [Invalid credentials]

state RegisteredUser <<choice>>
RegisteredUser --> ProfileManagement : [Manage profile]
RegisteredUser --> Logout : [Log out]
NewRegistration --> AccessEnded : [Access ended]
Login --> AccessEnded : [Access ended]
@enduml
